  "Limit, stop-loss, take-profit, DCA and TWAP orders, signed once and filled on chain within your limits.": "Ordens limitadas, stop-loss, take-profit, DCA e TWAP: assinadas uma vez e executadas on-chain dentro dos seus limites.",
