  "The Fence said no: {value}": "O Fence disse não: {value}",
  "The Fence's venue list and the router's choice. On chain only the call rules exist, which are derived from these venues.": "A lista de plataformas do Fence e a escolha do router. On-chain existem só as regras de chamada, derivadas dessas plataformas.",
